    <div class="relative">
    <div class="relative px-[20px] md:px-[30px]">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 bg-offWhite w-[33vw] h-[80px] lg:h-[120px]"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 screen-container flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-center">
            <div class="relative grow  w-full flex flex-row justify-between items-center h-[80px] bg-offWhite lg:h-[120px]">
                <div class="relative h-full max-h-[32px] max-w-[200px] lg:max-h-[51px] lg:max-w-[320px]">
                    <img src="/assets/park-chicago-rate-map.svg" alt="" class="object-contain w-full h-full">
                </div>
                <div class="whiteTriangle"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-12 flex justify-center max-w-max mx-auto flex-row gap-x-2 md:pt-0 md:pl-[15px] md:mr-0 md:min-w-[33%]">
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="px-[20px] py-[72px] md:px-[30px]">
        <div class="screen-container flex flex-col gap-y-[48px] md:flex-row md:gap-x-[30px] lg:gap-x-[80px]">
            
            <div class="w-full grow">
                <img class="h-[60px] mb-6" src="/assets/rates-vary-green.svg" alt="">
                <div class="h5 uppercase font-semibold mb-2">RATES VARY</div>
                <p>Depending on where and when you park in Chicago, the cost and hours of operation vary. We operate 365 days/year, unless otherwise posted. Please see the rate map below for more information.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="w-full grow">
                <img class="h-[60px] mb-6" src="/assets/price-range-green.svg" alt="">
                <div class="h5 uppercase font-semibold mb-2">PRICE RANGE</div>
                <p>Whether you use ParkChicago® or the pay boxes on the street, hourly parking rates range from $2.50 (outside the Loop and Central Business District) to $4.75 (Central Business District), to $4.75 (West Loop) and $7.00 (Loop).</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="w-full grow">
                <img class="h-[60px] mb-6" src="/assets/parkchicago-rates-signage.svg" alt="">
                <div class="h5 uppercase font-semibold mb-2">CHECK SIGNAGE</div>
                <p>Always remember to check the on-street pay boxes, ParkChicago®, or ParkChicago® Map for specific rates and times for where you parked, along with checking on-street signage posted by the City. The pay boxes and ParkChicago® will not accept payment if a parking fee is not required.</p>
            </div>
            
        </div>

        
    </div>

</div>

    

    
    <iframe src="https://map.parkchicago.com/" width="100%" height="800" frameborder="0"
    style="border: 0px;" allowfullscreen="" alt="ParkChicago Rate Map"></iframe>

    

    
    <div class="relative bg-white py-12 px-[30px]">
    

    <div class="screen-container">
        <div class="relative z-10 w-full mx-auto max-w-[480px] md:max-w-[690px] prose py-12  marker:text-dark lg:max-w-[800px] xl:max-w-[950px]">
            
            
                <ul><li><p>In Chicago neighborhoods (area outside the downtown area bounded by Roosevelt Avenue to the south, North Avenue to the north and Halsted Street to the west), most rates are $2.50 per hour from 8:00 a.m. to 10:00 p.m. On Sundays, motorists can park for free in some spaces in this area.<br></p></li><li><p>In the Central Business District outside the Loop (area bounded by Lake Michigan to the east, North Avenue to the north, Halsted to the west, and Roosevelt Road to the south), rates are $4.75 per hour from 8:00 a.m. to midnight.<br></p></li><li><p>In the West Loop (area is bounded by Grand Avenue to the north, the I-290 Expressway to the south, Ashland Avenue to the west and Halsted Street to the east), rates are $4.75 per hour.<br></p></li><li><p>In the Loop (area bounded by Lake Michigan to the east, Wacker Drive to the north and west, and Congress Parkway to the south), rates are $7.00 per hour from 8:00 a.m. to 9:00 p.m. and $3.50 per hour from 9:00 p.m. to 8:00 a.m.</p></li></ul><h5 style="text-align: center;"><strong>PARKING LOT TAX STRUCTURE *</strong></h5>
            


            
            
            
<div class="">
    <table class="rounded-[18px] overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
        
        
        <thead class="text-white" x-bind:class="highContrastMode ? 'bg-darkGreen' : 'bg-green'">
            <tr>
                
                <th class="text-white text-center font-medium border-l border-white"></th>
                
                <th class="text-white text-center font-medium border-l border-white"><p>STATE TAX</p>
</th>
                
                <th class="text-white text-center font-medium border-l border-white"><p>CITY TAX</p>
</th>
                
                <th class="text-white text-center font-medium border-l border-white"><p>COUNTY TAX</p>
</th>
                
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="bg-white">
        
        
        
        
        
        <tr class="border-dark">
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"><p>ALL PURCHASES</p>
</td>
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"><p>6%</p>
</td>
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"></td>
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"></td>
            
        </tr>
        
        
        
        
        
        <tr class="border-dark">
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"><p>DAILY &gt; $2.00</p>
</td>
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"></td>
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"><p>23.25%</p>
</td>
            
            <td class="text-center border-r border-dark last-of-type:border-r-0"><p>6%</p>
</td>
            
        </tr>
        
        </tbody>
        
        
        
    </table>
</div>
            


            
            
                <p style="text-align: center;"></p><p>*Taxes apply to rate and convenience fee.</p><p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> <strong>ZoneHop...Move Your Time</strong> Your purchased time can be moved and good until expiration at most meters OF THE SAME TYPE OF SPACE AND WITH THE SAME OR LOWER HOURLY RATE. However, purchased time cannot be moved between on-street meters and off-street metered lots, OR BETWEEN COMMERCIAL LOADING ZONES AND OTHER TYPES OF ON-STREET METERED PARKING SPACES. If you do move your vehicle to a space where moving time is permitted, please be sure to abide by all zone signage regarding restrictions and rules, including all signage of which may be posted on the SAME SIDE OF THE STREET ON THE BLOCK you parked your vehicle. For example, you can move your vehicle from a $4.75 zone to another $4.75 zone or $2.50 zone. If the rate at the new location is higher, you must create a new parking session or pay at the pay box. Make sure to check for rates, parking restrictions on the pay box and permanent or temporary signage to avoid a ticket.</p>
            


            
        </div>
