                <p></p><p>* Price is inclusive of all taxes (City, County and State)</p><p>Beginning January 1, 2025 per city ordinance, the city tax for parking in a parking lot for a 24-hour period or less, with a purchase amount of more than $2.00 has increased to 23.25%, daily.</p><p>Beginning on January 1, 2020, a tax is imposed on the privilege of using in this State a parking space in a parking area or garage for the use of parking one or more motor vehicles, recreational vehicles, or other self-propelled vehicles, at the rate of:</p><ul><li><p>6% of the purchase price for a parking space paid for on an hourly, daily, or weekly basis.</p></li><li><p>9% of the purchase price for a parking space paid for on a monthly or annual basis.</p></li></ul>
            


            
